python-siteconfig (1.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Install and activate the sitecustomize hook under the platform's
    default python3 version instead of a hardcoded python3.9, so
    application plugin discovery works on releases running a newer
    Python. Restore the original sitecustomize.py on package removal.

